# Generated by the editor (UnLuaNova toolbar → export IntelliSense, or -run=UnLuaNovaIntelliSense):
# declarations for the IDE and the type checkers, different on every machine, never checked in.
# Only the directory directly under the plugin - Plugins/<name>/Content/IntelliSense holds the
# hand-written annotations and is tracked.
Plugins/*/IntelliSense/
WindowsNoEditor/
MacNoEditor/
Android_*/
IOS/
*.sln
