/Benchmark
/Plugins/UnLuaNova/Source/UnLuaNovaDefaultParamCollector/obj
Plugins/UnLuaNova/Source/UnLuaNovaDefaultParamCollectorUbtPlugin/obj
# Generated on the machine that last opened/built the project:
#   *.slnx            - VS solution (same role as the already-ignored *.sln)
#   .vsconfig         - local VS component selection
#   *.ubtplugin.csproj.props - UBT writes the absolute EngineDir of this machine into it
*.slnx
/.vsconfig
*.ubtplugin.csproj.props

# MkDocs build output
/_site/
__pycache__
site

# 静态绑定产物（UnLuaNovaStaticBindingGenerator 在构建期 / 编辑器启动时生成）：
# 内容取决于 StaticBindingSelection 与宿主工程的类型集合，提交会跨工程互相污染。
# 默认落在插件自己的模块目录 —— 只有落在模块目录里才会被 UBT 编译。
Plugins/UnLuaNova/Source/UnLuaNova/Generated/
